BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:leros-xirokampos-panigiri-of-panagia-kavouradena-xirokampos-2027@aegeanblueprint.com
DTSTAMP:20260902T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270814
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270816
SUMMARY:Panigiri of Panagia Kavouradena\, Xirokampos
LOCATION:Xirokampos\, Leros\, Greece
DESCRIPTION:Leros' most photogenic chapel\, wedged between the rocks 800 m along the coast track from Xirokampos beach\, where a fisherman found the icon among crabs (kavouria). It is kept on 15 August with a liturgy and blessing at the chapel and a small feast in Xirokampos afterwards. Walk along the shore from the beach\; there is no parking at the chapel.\n\nhttps://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/leros/#xirokampos-panigiri-of-panagia-kavouradena-xirokampos
URL:https://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/leros/#xirokampos-panigiri-of-panagia-kavouradena-xirokampos
END:VEVENT
